    "detailed_description": "Pick up the enemy and throw it!<br />\r\nThis is an action game drawn with dots that gives you a nostalgic feel.<br />\r\nThe difficulty level is set to low.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main character of this game, Lifton, is skilled at &quot;lifting up&quot; his enemies.<br />\r\nIf you step on an enemy and flip them over, you can lift them up.<br />\r\nEnemies can be lifted up in two layers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe lifted enemy can be swapped up and down with the up key. And you can throw the enemies in the lower row by pressing the X key.<br />\r\nIf you lift a specific enemy, that enemy may exhibit mysterious abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*This game does not use any text other than the title and staff roll.",
